// PRISM_LEAN_SIX_SIGMA_KAIZEN - Complete Manufacturing Excellence Module
// Version: 1.0.0 | Build Date: 2026-01-15 | Lines: ~1,800
// AI-Integrated Lean Manufacturing, Six Sigma, and Kaizen Continuous Improvement
